{"id":"msg_m_subquest_1181_e","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_teddy","label":"Teddy · Quest"},"label":"2. Chat 2","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_subquest_1181_s","next":null,"speakers":{"teddy":"Teddy"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_0","type":"Narration","speaker":"teddy","key":null,"text":"Reward: In-Ear Monitor ×2","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_1","text":"Thanks for helping me get back!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_2","text":"The instructors at the academy are none the wiser.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_3","text":"Anyway, this is a small token of my appreciation.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_4","text":"So you made it back all right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_5","text":"Of course!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_6","text":"It was a pleasure to have watched you fight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_7","text":"I learned a lot and am much more confident in myself now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_8","text":"Also...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_9","text":"... Although I'm still unsure how I feel about Nikkes being friends with their Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_10","text":"every time I head up to the surface, I'll never forget that","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_11","text":"we're all fighting our battles in our own way!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_12","text":"The next time we meet, it'll be when I've made it as a Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_13","text":"I look forward to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_14","text":"Me too. Hehehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1181_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"teddy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1181_e_15","text":"Take it easy, Commander.","jump":null}],"chat":true}